# G12 (graphics): Ctrl+Page Up and Ctrl+Page Down scroll the page three lines without moving the caret, on a document of sixty lines (INT 16h scan
# codes 98h and A0h; the web page's wheel sends them). Four down, one up, then End: the caret was on the first line all along, so End
# brings the view back to it. Every frame's CRC-32 must equal the host's in both graphics modes.
@copy scroll.rtf
@open SCROLL.RTF
ctrlpagedown
ctrlpagedown
ctrlpagedown
ctrlpagedown
ctrlpageup
ctrlpageup
ctrlpageup
ctrlpageup
ctrlpageup                 # past the top: nothing moves
ctrlpagedown ctrlpagedown
end                   # the caret was still on the first line: the view goes back to it
